      "html": "<p>The working DTS path for e-receipts:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Talk to sales to see if you need receipts only, or invoices and receipts</li>\n<li>Subscribe to <a href=\"/products/ess/\">ESS</a>, or to <a href=\"/products/ers/\">ERS</a> if work is cashier-only</li>\n<li>Enter items, prices, POS devices, and users</li>\n<li>Request a <a href=\"/services/signature/\">signature or seal</a> if the certificate is not already on the token</li>\n<li>Install <a href=\"/products/esa/\">ESA</a> on the signing PC and plug in the token</li>\n<li>Issue the receipt in the system and track its status after tax submit</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Without a certificate, token, and ESA, legal submit does not complete even if the receipt appears on screen.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/contact/?service=einvoicing\">Start from the contact form</a></p>\n"
