      "html": "<h2>Is a receipt the same as an invoice?</h2>\n<p>No. They are different systems. See <a href=\"/knowledge/invoice-vs-receipt/\">invoice or receipt</a>.</p>\n<h2>Do I need a cashier device?</h2>\n<p>If you sell at a point of sale you need a device or screen that issues receipts. ESS covers receipts in the browser; ERS is cashier receipts only.</p>\n<h2>Is ESS enough without a signature?</h2>\n<p>ESS creates the document. Legal submit needs a certificate, a token, and ESA.</p>\n<h2>Where do I start?</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/knowledge/e-receipt-steps/\">E-receipt steps with DTS</a> or the <a href=\"/contact/?service=einvoicing\">contact form</a>.</p>\n<h2>Reply hours?</h2>\n<p>Sunday–Thursday, 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM. See <a href=\"/knowledge/contact-hours/\">How to reach DTS</a>.</p>\n"
